  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>[Congressional Record Volume 161, Number 73 (Wednesday, May 13, 2015)]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href='http://www.gpo.gov'>www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. TOM PRICE of Georgia:\nH.R. 2300.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nConsistent with the original understanding of the commerce\nclause, the authority to enact this legislation is found in\nClause 3 of Section 8, Article 1 of the U.S. Constitution.\nConsistent with Congress's power to tax, the authority to\nenact this legislation is also found in Clause 1 of Section\n8, Article 1 of the U.S. Constitution.\n[Page H2958]\n</pre>",
